# Signing material. The TestFlight workflow decodes secrets into these paths on
# the runner, and a local `fastlane beta` does the same, so keep them out of git.
*.p12
*.p8
AuthKey_*.p8
**/fastlane/dist_cert.p12
**/fastlane/AuthKey.p8
**/fastlane/report.xml
**/fastlane/README.md

